leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: builds a 2-cycle display list that draws fbufSave with cvgSave loaded as an I8 second texel and env alpha 32. Nothing calls it anywhere in the tree, so the name describes what the display list does rather than a known purpose.
Defined in soh/src/code/PreRender.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
